      "summary": "Saudi Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman held a phone conversation with UAE President Sheikh Mohamed bin Zayed Al-Nahyan to discuss regional developments and trilateral cooperation. The call was reported alongside a separate Trump-MBZ call, reflecting intensive Gulf-US coordination during the Iran war period."
    },
    {
